Other Go runtime dependencies include the Go standard library, Wails v3,
coder/websocket, adrg/xdg, godbus/dbus, go-ole, go-colorable, go-isatty,
golang.org/x/net, golang.org/x/sys, google.golang.org/protobuf and, on
